    "summary": {
      "i18n_key": "parts.pico.summary",
      "en": "The board runs the user's program in the iynk interpreter, in MicroPython or Arduino C++. Pins, PWM, I2C, serial and timing follow the pico board profile. It is not the RP2040 chip."
